[Enjin patch] ImGuizmo: two local fixes carried on top of upstream 1.10
========================================================================
Both were in our vendored copy with no record of them; found 2026-10-06 by
diffing against upstream while updating to 1.10. Upstream 1.10 has neither.

1. SetRect: mYMax was computed as mY + mXMax. It is mY + mHeight.
2. The gizmo's PushClipRect passes intersect_with_current_clip_rect = true, so
   the gizmo is clipped to the viewport panel and not drawn over its neighbours.

Upstream keeps its sources in src/. Ours sit flat in third_party/imguizmo, so
apply with:  git apply -p2 --directory=third_party/imguizmo <this file>
diff --git a/src/ImGuizmo.cpp b/src/ImGuizmo.cpp
index cf3890a..a81b1ad 100755
--- a/src/ImGuizmo.cpp
+++ b/src/ImGuizmo.cpp
@@ -975,7 +975,7 @@ namespace IMGUIZMO_NAMESPACE
       gContext.mWidth = width;
       gContext.mHeight = height;
       gContext.mXMax = gContext.mX + gContext.mWidth;
-      gContext.mYMax = gContext.mY + gContext.mXMax;
+      gContext.mYMax = gContext.mY + gContext.mHeight; // [Enjin patch] upstream adds mXMax, a typo
       gContext.mDisplayRatio = width / height;
    }
 
@@ -2679,7 +2679,7 @@ namespace IMGUIZMO_NAMESPACE
 
    bool Manipulate(const float* view, const float* projection, OPERATION operation, MODE mode, float* matrix, float* deltaMatrix, const float* snap, const float* localBounds, const float* boundsSnap)
    {
-      gContext.mDrawList->PushClipRect (ImVec2 (gContext.mX, gContext.mY), ImVec2 (gContext.mX + gContext.mWidth, gContext.mY + gContext.mHeight), false);
+      gContext.mDrawList->PushClipRect (ImVec2 (gContext.mX, gContext.mY), ImVec2 (gContext.mX + gContext.mWidth, gContext.mY + gContext.mHeight), true); // [Enjin patch] intersect with the window clip rect
 
       // Scale is always local or matrix will be skewed when applying world scale or oriented matrix
       ComputeContext(view, projection, matrix, (operation & SCALE) ? LOCAL : mode);
